      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BIDEN TIME (1) is a speedy type who has been freshened since a fading fourth here last time. Back in trip but rates highly on the big win the start prior and gets chance to atone. I LOVERAIN (5) finished 1.75 lengths from the winner in fourth last start after being in the firing line on the corner over 1300m at Katherine. Nicely placed to take this out. SOUTHAMPTON FLARE (2) kicked off this campaign with a win two runs ago. Couldn't follow that up last time out when seventh over 1200m at this track, beaten 2.25 lengths after he worked home well. Enjoys a drop in grade so he can return to the winners' list. ROMANTIC LOVE (3) ran below expectations last time at this track over 1200m, finishing sixth and beaten 4 lengths. Can figure prominently. RED EXTREME (8) is ready to win and worth including.",
